tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-2416-a-placed-module-written-as-its-file-is-offered-its-module.hero:6:5: error[package_unmarked]: `heroes.packages/json@1-k/` is the folder a fetch placed a package's tree in, which a `use` never names: a package's module is reached through its entry in the catalogue `heroes.toml` beside the file you compile, written between `<` `>` — `use <json>/parse`, `json` standing for the entry that placed this folder
